    "title": "MICROSERVICE-development-commerce-platform-api-List Api Inventorys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Inventory Management API provides a comprehensive interface for retrieving detailed information about the items available in the commerce platform's inventory. This endpoint enables users, such as merchants and supply chain managers, to access up-to-date inventory data, including stock levels, item specifications, and availability status. This functionality supports inventory oversight and decision-making processes essential for effective product management and sales strategies. By integrating this API, businesses can enhance their operational efficiency and improve customer satisfaction.",
